<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CSB《天上碑M》數據戰情室</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f8fafc;--bg2:#ffffff;--bg3:#f1f5f9;
  --border:#e2e8f0;--text:#1e293b;--text2:#64748b;
  --accent:#2563eb;--red:#dc2626;--orange:#d97706;
  --green:#16a34a;--purple:#7c3aed;
  --hl-r:#dc2626;--hl-o:#d97706;--hl-g:#16a34a;--hl-b:#2563eb;--hl-p:#7c3aed;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-size:14px;margin:0;padding:0;}
.header{background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 16px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;}
.header-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.header-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);}
.header-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px;}
.header-date{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);}
.scope-tag{display:inline-block;background:rgba(37,99,235,.1);color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.3);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-left:8px;}
.global-tag{display:inline-block;background:rgba(100,116,139,.1);color:#475569;border:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.3);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 6px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;margin-left:4px;vertical-align:middle;}
.chip-nav{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:6px 16px;background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);position:sticky;top:52px;z-index:99;}
.chip{padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;transition:all .18s;white-space:nowrap;}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);}
.chip.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent);}
.badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;margin-left:5px;vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap;}
.status-danger{background:rgba(220,38,38,.09);color:#b91c1c;border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.28);}
.status-warning{background:rgba(217,119,6,.09);color:#b45309;border:1px solid rgba(217,119,6,.28);}
.status-success{background:rgba(22,163,74,.09);color:#15803d;border:1px solid rgba(22,163,74,.28);}
.status-vip{background:rgba(124,58,237,.09);color:#6d28d9;border:1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.28);}
.status-info{background:rgba(37,99,235,.09);color:#1d4ed8;border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.28);}
.hl-r{color:var(--hl-r);font-weight:700;}
.hl-o{color:var(--hl-o);font-weight:700;}
.hl-g{color:var(--hl-g);font-weight:700;}
.hl-b{color:var(--hl-b);font-weight:700;}
.hl-p{color:var(--hl-p);font-weight:700;}
.main{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px 16px;}
.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:28px;}
.kpi-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.kpi-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:4px;height:100%;border-radius:2px 0 0 2px;}
.kpi-card.red::before{background:var(--red);}
.kpi-card.orange::before{background:var(--orange);}
.kpi-card.green::before{background:var(--green);}
.kpi-card.blue::before{background:var(--accent);}
.kpi-card.purple::before{background:var(--purple);}
.kpi-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;}
.kpi-value{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;margin:5px 0 3px;color:var(--text);}
.kpi-delta{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);}
.kpi-icon{position:absolute;right:14px;top:14px;font-size:22px;opacity:.15;}
.section{margin-bottom:36px;}
.section-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:14px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
.grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:18px;}
@media(max-width:900px){.grid-2,.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;}
.card-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;}
.card-title-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.scope-toggle{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0;}
.stog{padding:2px 9px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;transition:all .15s;white-space:nowrap;}
.stog:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);}
.stog.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent);}
.stog.active.gl{background:#475569;border-color:#475569;}
.chart-wrap{position:relative;height:220px;}
.chart-wrap-lg{position:relative;height:260px;}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;}
th{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);font-weight:600;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:top;}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
tr:hover td{background:#f8fafc;}
.tbl-scroll{overflow-x:auto;}
.dim-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;}
@media(max-width:700px){.dim-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.dim-card{border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;}
.dim-card.phenom{background:rgba(37,99,235,.06);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);}
.dim-card.cause{background:rgba(217,119,6,.06);border-left:3px solid var(--orange);}
.dim-card.impact{background:rgba(220,38,38,.06);border-left:3px solid var(--red);}
.dim-card.action{background:rgba(22,163,74,.06);border-left:3px solid var(--green);}
.dim-label{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;}
.dim-card.phenom .dim-label{color:var(--accent);}
.dim-card.cause .dim-label{color:var(--orange);}
.dim-card.impact .dim-label{color:var(--red);}
.dim-card.action .dim-label{color:var(--green);}
.action-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:16px;}
.action-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;border-left-width:4px;border-left-style:solid;}
.action-card.p0-card{border-left-color:var(--red);}
.action-card.p1-card{border-left-color:var(--orange);}
.action-card.p2-card{border-left-color:var(--accent);}
.action-card.p3-card{border-left-color:var(--green);}
.action-priority{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.p0{color:var(--red);}.p1{color:var(--orange);}.p2{color:var(--accent);}.p3{color:var(--green);}
.action-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;}
.action-body{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7;}
.warn-bar{background:rgba(220,38,38,.07);border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.2);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:12px;color:#b91c1c;font-weight:600;}
.info-bar{background:rgba(37,99,235,.06);border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.2);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:12px;color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:600;}
.progress-bar-wrap{background:var(--bg3);border-radius:4px;height:8px;margin-top:4px;}
.progress-bar{height:8px;border-radius:4px;}
/* Market cards */
.mkt-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px;}
@media(max-width:800px){.mkt-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
.mkt-card{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;}
.mkt-flag{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:4px;}
.mkt-name{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px;}
.mkt-rev{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);}
.mkt-arpu{font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;}
.mkt-vip{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px;}
/* Density meter */
.density-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.funnel-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:7px;font-size:11.5px;}
.funnel-label{width:140px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;}
.funnel-bar{height:12px;border-radius:4px;transition:width .4s ease;}
.funnel-val{width:60px;flex-shrink:0;text-align:right;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);font-weight:700;}
.density-label{font-size:12px;min-width:80px;font-weight:600;}
.density-bar{flex:1;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:4px;height:10px;overflow:hidden;}
.density-fill{height:100%;border-radius:4px;}
.density-val{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;min-width:50px;text-align:right;}

/* === P0~P3 Strategy Strip === */
.p-strip-wrap{margin-bottom:20px;}
.p-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;overflow:hidden;}
.p-strip-card{padding:14px 16px;border-right:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg2);transition:background .15s;}.p-strip-card:hover{background:var(--bg3);}
.p-strip-card:last-child{border-right:none;}
.p-strip-hd{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;margin-bottom:9px;padding-bottom:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
.ps-badge{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.4px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
.ps-b-p0{background:rgba(220,38,38,.12);color:#b91c1c;}
.ps-b-p1{background:rgba(217,119,6,.12);color:#b45309;}
.ps-b-p2{background:rgba(37,99,235,.12);color:#1d4ed8;}
.ps-b-p3{background:rgba(22,163,74,.12);color:#15803d;}
.p-strip-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;}
.p-strip-sub{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:1px;}
.p-strip-body{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.78;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;}
.p-strip-body li{margin-bottom:2px;}
.p-strip-body li::before{content:"→ ";color:var(--text2);}
.p-decision{background:rgba(220,38,38,.04);border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.18);border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:8px 18px;font-size:11px;color:#b91c1c;font-weight:600;}
@media(max-width:900px){.p-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
@media(max-width:500px){.p-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <div class="header-top">
    <div>
      <div class="header-title">🗡️ CSB《天上碑M》數據戰情室 <span class="scope-tag">TW / HK / MO（TWHK 版本）</span><span class="global-tag">依 Dashboard_需求確認表 v1 建置</span></div>
      <div class="header-sub">變身系統 × 裝備掉落 × PvP｜營運 2023-11-30 起（累計 1310 天）｜架構沿用 GNO Dashboard 範本（MS合金彈頭）四維分析法</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-date">最後更新：2026-08-26　｜　資料來源：Metabase（17張表）+ AppsFlyer + SilverLog/GoldLog + ID對照表</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="chip-nav">
  <button class="chip active" onclick="filterSec('all')">🌐 全部</button>
  <button class="chip" onclick="filterSec('retention')">🚨 流失與留存</button>
  <button class="chip" onclick="filterSec('funnel')">⏱️ 遊玩時長與轉化漏斗</button>
  <button class="chip" onclick="filterSec('economy')">🪙 貨幣與外掛</button>
  <button class="chip" onclick="filterSec('vip')">👑 VIP與商業化</button>
  <button class="chip" onclick="filterSec('pareto')">📊 帕累托分析</button>
  <button class="chip" onclick="filterSec('action')">💡 營運行動策略</button>
</div>
<div class="main" style="padding:16px;max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;">

<div class="kpi-grid">
  <div class="kpi-card blue">
    <div class="kpi-icon">👥</div>
    <div class="kpi-label">最新月活躍 MAU（2026-7）</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">1,557</div>
    <div class="kpi-delta">較2024-1高峰123,485已降98.7%（見§1.3）</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card green">
    <div class="kpi-icon">💰</div>
    <div class="kpi-label">全服歷史累計營收</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">$79.9M</div>
    <div class="kpi-delta">2023-11-30上線至今真實付費總額（見§5.1/4.11）</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card red">
    <div class="kpi-icon">🐳</div>
    <div class="kpi-label">Top 1% 付費集中度</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">71.0%</div>
    <div class="kpi-delta">121人貢獻超過7成營收，結構脆弱（見§5.1）</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card purple">
    <div class="kpi-icon">🚨</div>
    <div class="kpi-label">高危VIP待召回潛在營收</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">$12.7M</div>
    <div class="kpi-delta">Top30高危名單歷史累計消費（見§4.7）</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card orange">
    <div class="kpi-icon">📋</div>
    <div class="kpi-label">Dashboard資料完整度</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">44/48</div>
    <div class="kpi-delta">91.7%卡片已用真實數據回填（見§議題8）</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="warn-bar" style="background:rgba(22,163,74,.07);border:1px solid rgba(22,163,74,.25);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:16px;color:#15803d;">
✅ <b>資料完整度說明（2026-08-26 更新）</b>：本檔案沿用 GNO Dashboard 範本之 HTML/CSS/JS 架構與「現象→原因→影響→行動」四維分析法。
48張卡片中 <span class="badge status-success">✅ 真實數據</span> 共44張，已用貴方於 Metabase 實際執行 <code>CSB_Dashboard_SQL查詢語法庫.sql</code> 回填之查詢結果，及2026-07-14匯出之全服SilverLog/GoldLog真實LOG（3.1/3.3/3.7/交易所監控/貨幣帕累托/活動檔期效果分析）回填；
<span class="badge status-danger">⛔ 資料缺口已確認</span> 共4張，經核對17張Metabase表後確認對應資料表不存在（多集中在「遊戲伺服器端自訂行為事件」缺席，詳見§議題8）；
1.8/3.4/7.7已100%對照到真實禮包名稱或商城通用名稱；4.4僅剩1項因交易日期在OB活動排程與金流表皆查無記錄而顯示原始product_id，<b>全程不含任何推估或示意數值</b>。
</div>
<!-- ===== 區塊一：流失與留存 ===== -->
<div class="section" data-sec="retention">
  <div class="section-title">🚨 流失診斷 · 留存曲線 · 新手分析</div>
  <div class="info-bar" style="background:rgba(37,99,235,.06);border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.2);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:11.5px;margin-bottom:16px;">📍 對應需求確認表 區塊一（11項，全數「是」）。CSB 目前實際上線伺服器僅 server_id=11/12（真風雲錄01/02，2023-11-30上線），其餘規劃伺服器尚未開放，請以此核實 MAU/PCU 範疇。</div>
  <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
    
  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div class="card-title">[1.1] PCU 月峰值趨勢 <span class="badge status-success">✅ 真實數據</span></div>
    <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chart1_1"></canvas></div>
    <div class="dim-grid" style="margin-top:10px;">
      <div class="dim-card phenom"><div class="dim-label">🔵 現象</div>PCU月峰值從上線首月（2024-1-）<b class="hl-b">1,973</b> 一路下滑至 2026-7- 的 <b class="hl-r">154</b>，歷史最高峰為 2024-1-（1,973）。</div>
      <div class="dim-card cause"><div class="dim-label">🟡 原因</div>典型MMORPG「上線首月爆量、隨後自然衰退」曲線；CSB已營運2.5年+，屬正常生命週期後期現象，需搭配§1.3 MAU/§1.6新註冊數確認是否為老化加速或已趨穩。</div>
      <div class="dim-card impact"><div class="dim-label">🔴 影響</div>PCU持續探底代表同時在線密度降低，直接影響世界頻道熱度、交易所流動性與PvP匹配等依賴人口密度的系統體驗。</div>
      <div class="dim-card action"><div class="dim-label">🟢 行動</div>與§1.3/1.6交叉比對是否已止跌；若仍下滑，評估合服（見§7.5低人口伺服器識別）以拉高單服人口密度。</div>
    </div>
  </div>
    
  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div class="card-title">[1.2] PCU vs 平均CCU 峰谷比趨勢 <span class="badge status-success">✅ 真實數據</span></div>
    <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chart1_2"></canvas></div>
    <div class="dim-grid" style="margin-top:10px;">
      <div class="dim-card phenom"><div class="dim-label">🔵 現象</div>2026-7- 峰谷比為 <b class="hl-o">3.46</b>（PCU 154 vs 平均CCU 45），歷史峰谷比最高點在 2026-3-（3.48）。</div>
      <div class="dim-card cause"><div class="dim-label">🟡 原因</div>峰谷比長期落在2.6-2.7區間，顯示玩家高度集中在特定尖峰時段（可交叉§1.9 24小時分布確認確切時段），屬硬核MMORPG常見的「下班/假日集中在線」模式。</div>
      <div class="dim-card impact"><div class="dim-label">🔴 影響</div>離峰時段在線密度僅為尖峰的1/2.6，離峰時段的組隊/交易/PvP體驗可能明顯弱於尖峰，影響全時段留存。</div>
      <div class="dim-card action"><div class="dim-label">🟢 行動</div>離峰時段可規劃限時活動或雙倍經驗，引導玩家分流上線；長期監控峰谷比是否隨MAU下滑而惡化。</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
    
  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div class="card-title">[1.3] MAU 月活躍趨勢 <span class="badge status-success">✅ 真實數據</span></div>
    <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chart1_3"></canvas></div>
    <div class="dim-grid" style="margin-top:10px;">
